    "title": "Lions Fall to Palm Beach Atlantic 15-3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago WEST PALM BEACH, FL – The Emmanuel Women's Lacrosse team traveled to West Palm Beach, FL today to take on Palm Beach Atlantic University in non-conference action. The Sailfish jumped out to an early advantage, taking a 12-0 lead into the half, but the Lions responded well, battling to close the gap, making the final score 15-3. The Sailfish opened the scoring with a 12-0 scoring run to take the 12-0 lead into the halftime break. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
